SUMMARY:Gentlemen Prefer Blondes | Matinee Classics
DESCRIPTION:Lorelei Lee (Marilyn Monroe) is a beautiful showgirl engaged 
 to be married to the wealthy Gus Esmond (Tommy Noonan)\, much to the disa
 pproval of Gus' rich father\, Esmond Sr.\, who thinks that Lorelei is jus
 t after his money. When Lorelei goes on a cruise accompanied by her best 
 friend\, Dorothy Shaw (Jane Russell)\, Esmond Sr. hires private detective
  Ernie Malone (Elliott Reid) to follow her and report any questionable be
 havior that would disqualify her from the marriage. [91 min\; musical\, c
 omedy\; English]
