 an)\, much to the disapproval of Gus' rich father\, Esmond Sr.\, who thin
 ks that Lorelei is just after his money. When Lorelei goes on a cruise ac
 companied by her best friend\, Dorothy Shaw (Jane Russell)\, Esmond Sr. h
 ires private detective Ernie Malone (Elliott Reid) to follow her and repo
 rt any questionable behavior that would disqualify her from the marriage.
