SUMMARY:Hellboy | Friday Night Frights\, Jorgensen Guest Filmmaker Series
 \, Doug Jones: Of Monsters and Men
DESCRIPTION:At the end of World War II\, the Nazis attempt to open a port
 al to a paranormal dimension in order to defeat the Allies\, but are only
  able to summon a baby demon who is rescued by Allied forces and dubbed "
 Hellboy" (Ron Perlman). Sixty years later\, Hellboy serves as an agent in
  the Bureau of Paranormal Research and Defense\, where he\, aided by Abe 
 Sapien (Doug Jones)\, a merman with psychic powers\, and Liz Sherman (Sel
 ma Blair)\, a woman with pyrokinesis\, protects America against dark forc
 es. [122 min\; action\, fantasy\; English]
