SUMMARY:Sweet Sweetback's Baadasssss Song | The Long Revolution
DESCRIPTION:After saving a Black Panther from some racist cops\, a Black 
 sex worker goes on the run from "the man" with the help of the Black comm
 unity and some disillusioned Hells Angels\, soundtracked by original musi
 c from Earth\, Wind\, and Fire. Preserved in the Library of Congress' Nat
 ional Film Registry for its cultural\, historical\, and aesthetic signifi
 cance\, this Blaxploitation classic inspired everyone from Huey Newton to
  Spike Lee. [97 min\; thriller\, drama\; English]
